        <dc:title>Embracing Her Role as Queen</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Warbaum, Joshiah" opf:role="aut">Warbaum, Joshiah</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2016-07-06T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;"What do boys know about having fun, anyway?"   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That's the thought process of Hannah the jaguar, as her relationship with her boyfriend, Ricky, continues to go down the drain.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ricky knows it, and just when all hope seems lost for the couple, he makes a risky move at a bar called "The Occult," a place known for spooky decor, and even spookier drinks.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One particular drink, "The Heated Wolfess," ends up being more than just a catchy title, and suddenly, Hannah is left with a woman standing over her who promises to meet her every sexual desire!   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can she possibly give in to her fantasies when she's still committed to her failing relationship with Ricky?   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The answer is much closer than she thinks...&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
